dd></div><div class='progression-stat'><dt>Quests complete</dt><dd data-progression-stat='quests-complete' aria-live='polite'>—</dd></div></dl><p class='progression-storage' data-progression-storage-status role='status' aria-live='polite'>Guest progress is stored only in this browser.</p></section><section class='progression-section' aria-labelledby='profile-scores-title'><div class='progression-section-heading'><div><p class='section-kicker'>WEBSITE RECORD</p><h2 id='profile-scores-title'>Scores &amp; activity</h2></div></div><div class='progression-empty'><p>No local game scores are available. Website route visits may appear as local activity, not as game scores, published lore, achievements, or canonical world, character, or story completion.</p></div></section><section class='progression-section' aria-labelledby='profile-collection-title'><div class='progression-section-heading'><div><p class='section-kicker'>COLLECTION</p><h2 id='profile-collection-title'>Worlds, characters &amp; stories</h2></div></div><div class='progression-empty' data-progression-discovery-list><p>Website route-visit activity may appear here. It records visited pages only and does not indicate canonical world, character, or story completion.</p></div></section><nav class='progression-nav' aria-label='Feast Pass pages'><a href='/feast-pass/'>Feast Pass</a><a href='/feast-pass/quests/'>Quests</a><a href='/feast-pass/rewards/'>Rewards</a><a href='/profile/' aria-current='page'>Guest profile <span class='sr-only'>(current page)</span></a></nav><section class='progression-controls' aria-labelledby='profile-controls-title'><div><h2 id='profile-controls-title'>Local data controls</h2><p>Clear website progression only. Unrelated game and mobile data are not affected.</p></div><button class='button-link button-link--secondary' type='button' data-clear-progression>Clear website progression</button></section></div>"
